{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S08（20秒）、S11（22秒）等短段落中感受文字仍然偏密，部分小字来不及扫完，整体扫读不如X轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】把每段叙事的关键转折和心理动因凸显出来，观众更容易抓住他为什么舍不得、为什么不敢回去，以及最后如何重新决定生活；反复出现的「当作自己人」「受过的气」「不再为留住谁咽下委屈」也让前后形成了清楚的情感主线。更重要的是，Y的感受描述有音乐、身体、情绪之间的细微对应，并通过到时出现避免把所有细节同时堆出来；不过短时段仍有明显的信息拥挤，X的短词和双栏布局反而更便于快速扫视。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c434754a-e5e5-487c-9b7c-9a520dffd8c5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T172520190479Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:26:02.420350+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6253ec7aa1485267fa60d305f73d1904bfbe3775c8ec3b5ee79477bc5d53797f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat